// purpose: defender xdr threat entities abusing cloudflare
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Detections.AI/blob/e9aedb2826722ccf078f2d099a8f5faac74f704d/KQL/defender-xdr-threat-entities-abusing-cloudflare.kql
// kind: repo
